        "text_Pc3nJj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We understand that surrendering a beloved pet is never an easy decision. Every situation is unique, and we know this choice often comes with a great deal of emotion. At Lucky Penny Kitties, our goal is to ensure that every cat is safe, cared for, and given the opportunity to find a loving forever home.</p><p>As a <strong>foster-based rescue</strong>, we have limited space and can only accept owner surrenders when foster homes or openings are available. <strong>Please note that intake is not guaranteed</strong>, as we are often at full capacity due to the overwhelming number of cats and kittens in need of assistance.</p><p>If we are unable to accept your cat immediately, we will do our best to place you on our waiting list and contact you as soon as space becomes available.</p><h2><strong>Surrender Fee</strong></h2><p>A <strong>$25 surrender fee per cat</strong> is required upon intake. This fee helps offset the initial costs of care, including food, litter, veterinary services, vaccinations, and other essential supplies, allowing us to continue helping as many animals as possible.</p><h2><strong>How to Request a Surrender</strong></h2><p>To begin the surrender process, please complete our <strong>Surrender Request Form</strong>.</p><p>When submitting your request, please include as much information as possible, including:</p><ul><li>Recent photos<br/></li><li>Age<br/></li><li>Personality and temperament<br/></li><li>Medical history<br/></li><li>Any special needs or behavioral concerns<br/></li></ul><p>The more information you provide, the better we can determine the most appropriate placement and timeline for your cat.</p><h2><strong>What Happens Next?</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>If an opening is available,</strong> a member of our team will contact you to schedule an intake appointment.<br/></li><li><strong>If we are currently at capacity,</strong> your request will be added to our waiting list, and we will reach out as soon as an appropriate foster home or space becomes available.<br/></li></ul><p>At Lucky Penny Kitties, we believe that asking for help is an act of love. We will never judge your circumstances. Our mission is to support both animals and the people who care for them while working together to find the best possible outcome for every cat.</p><p><strong>Thank you for trusting Lucky Penny Kitties with the care and future of your feline companion.</strong> ❤️🐾</p>"
          }
        },
